                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[h1]Abstract: DON'T BUY!!![/h1]\n\nDev abandoned the game, despite he knows the game is in a bad shape possible, he not removed it from the store, he knows it have bugs, achievements are broken, and still sell this crap for more than $ 1.25, his answer... play others game I made, those are better... L-A-M-E. I just reported it. Rate 0/10 - (☆☆☆☆☆)\n\n[quote]thecrow256  [developer] Posted: 14 Sep, 2018 @ 8:04am\nI am really sorry about the bugs, today I am going to release in its current state.\nMy second year in college started, I am really tired of this game and the bugs that I have 0 understanding of why they happen.\nIts my first game on steam after all, and I will work hard on another game in a genre that I think I will enjoy making and simpler in execution.[/quote]\n\nWith the money he still make, he could employ someone that could correct all his mess, but... NOOO, let's still sell a broken game to people.",
